WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.290
From nineteen thirty-nine
to nineteen forty-five,

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:07.930
war spread across Europe,
Africa, Asia and the oceans.

3
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.350
In Britain, German bombs
fell on the cities.

4
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.430
And the Nazi state and its
collaborators carried out the

5
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.410
Holocaust: the deliberate,

6
00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.730
systematic murder of around
six million Jewish people.

7
00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:25.150
The Nazis also murdered Roma and
Sinti people, disabled people,

8
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:25.590
and others.

9
00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.090
How did this happen?

10
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.390
And how do historians know?

11
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.710
In this mission, you'll
study key moments of the war,

12
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.410
the stages of the Holocaust,

13
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.570
and how historians
question their sources.

14
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:42.670
Your mission: find out how
historians build a true picture of

15
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:43.850
these years.
